# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# winoracle x86 (WoW64), main mode. Identical to the x64 run except:
#  drv REFERENCE(2): S_OK here (SysWOW64 carries a reference rasterizer);
#                    x64 answers DXGI_ERROR_UNSUPPORTED. Adapter-dependent.
#  feature 16 (GPU_VIRTUAL_ADDRESS_SUPPORT): {0x1f,0x1f} (x64: {0x20,0x2f}).
# Vitreo's x86 run matches its own x64 run line for line, so the stdcall
# thunks are not a factor in this area.
